#. key: amulet
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet"
msgid ""
"An amulet to be worn as jewellery around the neck, charged with arcane powers\n"
"of unknown provenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Een talisman die rond de nek als juweel gedragen dient te worden, opgeladen met\n"
"mysterieuze en onbekende krachten.\n"

#. key: potion
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion"
msgid ""
"An unlabelled flask containing a single dose of unknown liquid.\n"
msgstr ""
"Een ongelabeld flesje met een enkele dosis van een onbekende vloeistof in.\n"

#. key: ring
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring"
msgid ""
"A ring charged with arcane forces of unknown provenance, to be worn as jewellery\n"
"on a finger.\n"
msgstr ""
"Een talisman die mysterieuze en onbekende krachten bezit, die rond een vinger\n"
"gedragen wordt als juweel.\n"

#. key: scroll
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll"
msgid ""
"A disposable arcane formula inscribed on parchment by a professional scribe or\n"
"sorcerer. Anyone can evoke the power of the arcane formula by reading it out\n"
"loud, but the nature of that power is not a priori apparent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Een magische formule beschreven op perkament door een professioneel tovenaar.\n"
"Iedereen kan de kracht van de formule oproepen door de spreuk hardop uit te\n"
"spreken, maar de aard van die kracht is a priori niet duidelijk.\n"

#. key: staff
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff"
msgid ""
"A staff improved with arcane powers of unknown nature.\n"
msgstr ""
"Een staf, vervolmaakt met magische krachten van onbekende aard.\n"

#. key: wand
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand"
msgid ""
"An unusually magical sort of stick.\n"
msgstr ""
"Een stokje. Misschien magisch.\n"

#. key: banish ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:banish ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to banish a creature into the Abyss. If the attempt succeeds, you gain\n"
"some piety and the creature's full experience value. Even creatures that resist\n"
"are left malmutated and weakened by the brush with the Abyss. Invocations skill\n"
"makes Banishment harder to resist.\n"
msgstr ""
"Probeert een monster naar de Diepte te verbannen.\n"

#. key: bend time ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bend time ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to slow down everyone adjacent to you. High Invocations skill makes it\n"
"harder to resist.\n"
msgstr ""
"Probeert iedereen rondom je te vertragen. Hoe hoger je Invocatievaardigheid,\n"
"hoe moeilijker het is voor monsters om zich hiertegen te verzetten.\n"

#. key: sacrifice an eye ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice an eye ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices an eye, causing you to have a much harder time hitting targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Offert een oog op, waardoor je moeilijker doelwitten kan raken, alsof\n"
"je een amulet van onnauwkeurigheid draagt.\n"

#. key: tutorial1 go_on
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 go_on"
msgid ""
"You're doing great! Now, explore a bit until you reach the next blue square.\n"
msgstr ""
"Je doet het geweldig! Verken nu een beetje totdat je het blauwe vierkant hebt\n"
"bereikt.\n"

#. key: tutorial1 door
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 door"
msgid ""
"You can open a closed door by walking into it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Je kan een gesloten deur openen door erin te lopen.\n"

#. key: tutorial1 close_door
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 close_door"
msgid ""
"To close an open door, press <input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"Druk op <input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input> om een deur dicht te doen.\n"

#. key: tutorial1 water
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 water"
msgid ""
"Note how you can move through shallow but not through deep water.\n"
msgstr ""
"Merk op dat je door ondiep water kan bewegen, maar niet door diep water.\n"

#. key: tutorial2 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 start"
msgid ""
"This lesson will teach you about monsters and fighting. First, we need a\n"
"weapon! Go and grab the one lying over there.\n"
msgstr ""
"In deze les leer je over monsters en vechten. Maar eerst hebben we een wapen\n"
"nodig! Pak deze die hier ligt.\n"

#. key: tutorial2 melee
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 melee"
msgid ""
"To attack a monster with your bare hands or wielded weapon, simply walk into\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Om een monster aan te vallen met de blote hand, of het wapen dat je vast hebt,\n"
"ren je er gewoon tegen.\n"

#. key: tutorial2 resting_reminder
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 resting_reminder"
msgid ""
"Remember, you can rest up with <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"Onthoud: je kunt rusten via <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>.\n"

#. key: tutorial2 downstairs
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 downstairs"
msgid ""
"Well done! After resting to full health continue to the next level with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles> or by <input>clicking</input>\n"
"on your character</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"Goed zo! Ga nadat je gezondheidsmeter helemaal is bijgevuld verder naar het\n"
"volgende niveau via <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input>.\n"

#. key: tutorial2 newlevel
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 newlevel"
msgid ""
"Remember: You can reread old messages with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"Onthoud: je kunt oude berichten opnieuw lezen via\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>.\n"

#. key: tutorial2 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've survived your first batch of monsters! To exit the\n"
"tutorial, simply go down these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gefeliciteerd! Je hebt je eerste troep monsters overleefd! Om de tutorial te\n"
"verlaten, ga je deze trap af.\n"

#. key: tutorial2 exit
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 exit"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>Tutorial 2 summary: Combat</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Weapons<console> <cyan>)</cyan></console></yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>  pick up an item\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>  equip an item<localtiles>\n"
"  You can also do this by <input>clicking</input> on the weapon in your inventory.</localtiles>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUIVER_ITEM]</input>  adjust your quiver\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Monsters</yellow><localtiles>\n"
"  <input>mouseover</input>  examine a monster\n"
"  <input>rightclick</input> read a more detailed description</localtiles><nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input>  examine a monster\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input> read a more detailed description</nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PRIMARY_ATTACK]</input> fire held weapon\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input> fire quiver at pre-targeted monster\n"
"  <input>shift-tab</input>, <input>p</input> fire quiver at closest monster\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input> target another monster<localtiles>\n"
"  You can also fire a missile by <input>clicking</input> on it, then confirming the target with <input>Enter</input>.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Resting</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input>  wait and rest a single turn\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  wait and rest up to 100 turns\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"<yellow>Wapens<console> <cyan>)</cyan></console></yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>  voorwerp oppakken\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WIELD_WEAPON]</input>  wapen hanteren<localtiles>\n"
"  Je kunt dit ook doen door in je inventaris op het wapen te <input>klikken</input>.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Monsters</yellow><localtiles>\n"
"  <input>mouse-over</input>  monster examineren\n"
"  <input>rechter muisknop</input> gedetailleerde omschrijving lezen</localtiles><nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input>  monster examineren\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input> gedetailleerde omschrijving lezen</nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input> munitie op vooraf geselecteerd monster afvuren\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input> ander monster selecteren<localtiles>\n"
"  Je kunt ook een voorwerp afvuren door hierop te <input>klikken</input> en het doel te bevestigen met <input>Enter</input>.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Rusten</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input>  een beurt wachten en rusten\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  tot maximaal 100 beurten wachten en rusten\n"
"\n"
"                         <cyan>Druk op een <input>toets</input> om dit scherm leeg te maken...</cyan>\n"

#. key: tutorial3 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 start"
msgid ""
"In this lesson you're going to learn about items and how to use them.\n"
msgstr ""
"In deze les leer je over voorwerpen, en hoe ze te gebruiken.\n"

#. key: tutorial3 autopickup
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 autopickup"
msgid ""
"Some types of items<tiles>, marked with a green frame,</tiles> are picked up\n"
"automatically as you step on them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sommige voorwerpen<tiles>, aangeduid met een groen kadertje,</tiles> worden\n"
"automatisch opgepakt als je erop stapt.\n"

#. key: tutorial3 gold
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 gold"
msgid ""
"Gold can be spent in shops. It takes no inventory space and cannot be dropped.\n"
msgstr ""
"Goud kan je besteden in winkels. Het is gewichtloos, en je kan het niet\n"
"neerleggen.\n"

#. key: tutorial3 shop
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 shop"
msgid ""
"Shops offer a variety of items, but they don't buy items from anyone.\n"
msgstr ""
"Winkels bieden een waaier aan voorwerpen aan, maar je kan er niets verkopen.\n"

#. key: tutorial3 optional_battle
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 optional_battle"
msgid ""
"Warning, this way leads to <lightred>a difficult battle</lightred>. You may\n"
"choose to use what you've learned so far in a fight, or try to reach the other\n"
"exit on the island. Either way, it may be a good idea to do some shopping, if\n"
"you haven't already.\n"
msgstr ""
"Waarshuwing: deze weg leidt naar een <lightred>moeilijk gevecht</lightred>.\n"
"Ofwel gebruik je de vechtkennis die je zonet hebt opgedaan, ofwel probeer je de\n"
"andere kant van het eiland te bereiken. Hoe dan ook is het een goed idee om\n"
"eerst wat te winkelen, als je dat nog niet gedaan hebt.\n"

#. key: tutorial3 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Well done! To exit the tutorial, simply go down these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Goed gedaan! Om deze uitleg te sluiten ga je de trap af.\n"

#. key: tutorial3 exit
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 exit"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>Tutorial 3 summary: Items</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Item commands</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>  pick up an item\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>  drop an item\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>  equip armour, weapons, and jewellery\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_UNEQUIP]</input>  unequip armour, weapons, and jewellery\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input>  read a scroll\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</input>  quaff a potion\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input>  evoke a wand\n"
"\n"
"  Use and (un)equip commands are also available from item descriptions in the inventory menu (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>).<localtiles>\n"
"  And of course, <input>mouseclicks</input> also work.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Other</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input> access the command help\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>  explore automatically\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> search for items/features previously seen<localtiles>\n"
"  Several of these commands can also be executed by clicking in the <w>command panel</w>.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"<yellow>Voorwerpopdrachten</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>  voorwerp oppakken\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WEAR_ARMOUR]</input>  kledij dragen\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input>  perkament lezen\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WIELD_WEAPON]</input>  wapen hanteren\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</input>  drankje drinken\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input>  staf evoceren\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WEAR_JEWELLERY]</input>  sieraad dragen\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REMOVE_JEWELLERY]</input>  sieraad verwijderen\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>  voorwerp laten vallen\n"
"  Daarnaast zijn er gebruiksopdrachten in het inventarismenu (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>) beschikbaar, net als de omschrijvingen van voorwerpen.<localtiles>\n"
"  En natuurlijk werken ook <input>muisklikken</input>.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Overig</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input> opdrachthulp openen\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_RESISTS_SCREEN]</input>  personageoverzicht weergeven\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>  bekwaamheid gebruiken\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>  automatisch verkennen\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> naar eerder geziene voorwerpen/kenmerken zoeken<localtiles>\n"
"  Een aantal van deze opdrachten kan ook worden uitgevoerd door in het <w>opdrachtenvenster</w> te klikken.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"                         <cyan>Druk op een <input>toets</input> om dit scherm leeg te maken...</cyan>\n"

#. key: tutorial4 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 start"
msgid ""
"In this lesson you're going to learn how to memorise and cast spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"In deze les leer je hoe spreuken te leren en gebruiken.\n"

#. key: tutorial4 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you're a real wizard now! To exit the tutorial, simply go down\n"
"these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Super, je bent een echte tovenaar nu! Om deze uitleg te sluiten ga je de trap\n"
"af.\n"

#. key: tutorial5 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 start"
msgid ""
"In this lesson you're going to learn about gods and how to use their powers.\n"
msgstr ""
"In deze les bekijken we goden en leer je hoe hun krachten te gebruiken.\n"

#. key: tutorial5 piety_on_kill
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 piety_on_kill"
msgid ""
"Some gods really like it if you kill monsters in their name. Let the slaughter\n"
"begin!\n"
msgstr ""
"Sommige goden appreciëren het als je in hun naam monsters verslaat. Maak er een\n"
"slachtpartij van!\n"

#. key: tutorial5 berserk2
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 berserk2"
msgid ""
"Berserk is also really useful against multiple enemies — as long as you don't\n"
"run out of steam in-between.\n"
msgstr ""
"Berserk is ook erg nuttig tegen meerdere vijanden — zo lang je tussenin niet\n"
"uitgeput geraakt.\n"

#. key: tutorial5 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've finished the last tutorial lesson and are now ready for\n"
"the real game. Good luck!\n"
"\n"
"To exit the tutorial, just go down these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gefeliciteerd! Je hebt de laatste tutorial-les voltooid; nu ben klaar voor het\n"
"echte spel. Veel succes!\n"
"\n"
"Om de tutorial te verlaten, ga je deze trap af.\n"

